          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తిరుగుబాటు — tirugubāṭu — \"a rebellion; a revolt\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "రైతులు రాజు మీద తిరుగుబాటు చేశారు. raitulu rāju mīda tirugubāṭu cēśāru. The farmers rebelled against the king."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తిరుగుబాటు (tirugubāṭu) చేయు, to rebel; from తిరుగు, to turn."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తిరుగుబాటు (tirugubāṭu) is native Dravidian, built on tirugu, \"to turn, turn back\" (DEDR 3246): a turning against."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
